WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.220
What some people are concerned is that

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.360
this Leninist organization which is

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.670
looking at what's happened successfully

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:13.820
in El Salvador, in Nicaragua, in Venezuela,

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:16.240
where these revolutionary governments took power,

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.940
that they want to replicate that in Colombia.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:22.320
The guerrillas negotiated such a generous package of

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.700
economic assistance, social support for

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.080
these areas of past conflict where

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.600
the guerrillas are actually be resettling.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.000
It's such a generous package, as a matter of

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.100
fact, that the Colombian state doesn't

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:37.320
have the means to comply.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:40.460
If the state doesn't comply with its commitments,

00:00:40.469 --> 00:00:42.449
it's going to be subject to criticism.

00:00:42.449 --> 00:00:45.560
So almost immediately the FARC will attack

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:46.739
the fact that the government's not

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:49.140
complying with its commitments

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:50.140
under the peace agreement.

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:53.440
The guerrillas could use that criticism and that's the concern.

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:55.620
Using the democratic means,

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:59.190
abusing representative democracy, and

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:01.590
then eventually taking power and

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:03.359
dissolving the institutions so that they

00:01:03.359 --> 00:01:05.640
can hold power in perpetuity.

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.300
What do you think's in store for Colombia?

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:10.439
Let us know in the comments

00:01:10.439 --> 00:01:12.000
section and let us know what other

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.200
topics you want AEI scholars to cover in 60 seconds.

